        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 8190/300-US32D, 15-3/4 Inch Stainless steel Modern Square Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern 1-1/8 inch square stainless steel door pull is made by Omnia out of high quality Stainless Steel. The soft brushed stainless steel finish requires very little maintenance. This 15-3/4 Inch Stainless steel Modern Square Door Pull is designed to enhance any setting where a modern look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/23-inch-stainless-steel-modern-square-door-handle-omnia-8190-400-us32d\"><b>23-5/8\" Modern Square Door Handle</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/15-inch-square-stainless-glass-door-handles-pair-omnia-8190-b300-us32d\"><b>15-3/4\" Square Glass Door Handles</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 8190/300-US32D Square Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount Holes: 11-13/16\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/omnia-pull-mounting-btb.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Omnia Pull Back to Back Mounting Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
